# Debug/screenshot artifacts — root/scratch PNGs are ignored, but the π
# visual-runtime lane's evidence (precept `tranche/SPEC.md §The π visual-runtime
# lane`, edict `8ccf9f4`) MUST be committable: every-page paired before/after
# captures live under `docs/tranches/<L>/audit/screenshots/{before,after}/`, and
# app figures under `assets/`. The blanket `*.png` ignore otherwise made the
# lane's archive-not-delete evidence un-committable (gap1, 2026-06-04).
*.png
!assets/**/*.png
!docs/**/*.png

